  "facts": {
    "area_return_order": "After hurt: a blocking Player with positive shield ticks receives native use-item cooldown/stop-use; positive lift adds Y independently of hurt; STUN requires hurt=true and positive duration; requested launch ignores hurt and status success. One-argument addEffect has no explicit effect source. Reuses R2k2b STUN/admission/removal rather than defining a new status.",
    "area_recipient_admission": "Native nearby helper excludes self, requires 3D distance <= range+recipientWidth/2 and recipientY <= bossY+height within the inflated box. AreaAttack uses (horizontalDistance<=range AND relativeAngle in [-arc/2,arc/2]) OR the two wrap-angle clauses, then excludes all Ender_Guardian_Entity instances. The wrap clauses do not repeat the horizontal-distance condition; nearby admission still applies. No additional alliance, alive, creative or spectator predicate is added by AreaAttack. Gameplay branches are server-only.",
    "selection": "Actual STUN/Levitation presence forces middle-distance uppercut. Uppercut cooldown is write/decrement bookkeeping, not admission. Protected selector priority reused.",
    "projectile": "Staged custom bullet motion; mob_projectile direct=bullet/causing=livingOwner. Only successful hurt enables enchantment callback and Levitation100/0. Native collision/impact cancellation preserved.",
    "runes": "Void Rune, not Evoker Fangs. Config9 stored; delayed repeated native indirect_magic or ownerless magic, bidirectional allies, ordinary hurt cooldown, no added enchantment callback.",
    "vortex": "Full-vector pull/downward write precedes separate native explosion. Fresh source actors=Guardian/Guardian; reload can retain null cached owner because server tick does not call getOwner.",
    "mass": "MassDestruction is native mob_attack plus unconditional custom launch/conditional shield disable; no native explosion or STUN. Separate tag-bound terrain destruction.",
    "body": "Continuous absolute horizontal repulsion0.1; no target/AI/alive/ally/hurt guard. Outgoing write differs from canBePushedByEntity=false.",
    "respawner": "Shared death admission reused. Configured home respawner creates fresh Guardian with used-mass defaulttrue, unlike altar initialization; current-level support read vs home-level write preserved."
  },
